{"author":{"id":"8022379585b4ab99ca8775db3eb67d33fcb256817114c28e51ccc1e9f55cdec4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792310567,"nonce":"WdrwbR1G+7HxuJZ6DS2InO7ACeE=","title":"get_or_alloc_liveness_slot has dead _builder + _entry_block params and a stale doc-comment after the pre-walk refactor. Also ...","message":"After commit b3d9968 reworked `cranelift_backend.rs` liveness slot seeding from lazy-first-encounter to entry-block pre-walk, two cosmetic / robustness items remain:\n\n**Dead params**: `get_or_alloc_liveness_slot` at `cranelift_backend.rs:2188-2206` still takes `_builder: \u0026mut FunctionBuilder` and `_entry_block: Block` as arguments. Both are unused now that the function is a pure lookup that panics on miss. The doc-comment at lines 2106-2110 advertises a lazy-allocation API that no longer exists. Strip params + rewrite doc.\n\n**Non-exhaustive pre-walk**: `collect_liveness_ids` at `cranelift_backend.rs:2167-2180` only matches `MarkMoved { src }` and `CheckLive { src, .. }`. If a future ownership / liveness instruction is added to `IrInstruction` without updating the pre-walk, `get_or_alloc_liveness_slot` will `panic!(\"liveness slot not pre-allocated\")` at codegen time — loud, but a defensive doc-comment on the IrInstruction enum noting \"every variant whose execution depends on liveness state must be added to collect_liveness_ids\" would prevent the bug shape from recurring.\n\n**Why:** the lazy API was unsound (ExplicitSlot starts undefined); replacing it with pre-walk + pure lookup was a correctness fix. The dead params are vestigial scaffolding from the bridge phase. Not removed in the original commit to keep the diff focused on the soundness fix.\n\n**How to apply:** include the dead-param cleanup + collect_liveness_ids exhaustiveness note in any future Cranelift backend touch (e.g. when adding the addInto fused-kernel codegen path). Don't ship as a standalone refactor; bundle with the next adjacent edit.\n\nRelated: [[project-move-clone-enforced]] (introduces the seeding pre-walk).\n\n---\nArchived from Claude memory `bugs_cranelift_liveness_dead_params` on 2026-10-18. A record of past work; open items in it may have their own issues.","files":null}]}